This distribution uses a MODIFIED copy, not the upstream runtime.
libomp-private.patch disables duplicate-runtime process registration and cleanup
under SBC_LIBOMP_PRIVATE, retaining x86 system-tick initialization.
libomp-private-windows.patch permits a private static Windows build and disables
DLL import-library/export-file generation for that static archive.
Both exact patches accompany this notice. Runtime symbols are private; OMPT,
OMPD, ITT and offloading are disabled. Upstream copyright headers are retained.
